{"3118860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meat Lovers", "steam_appid": 3118860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncle Sam left for a week-long vacation and put you in charge of his vegetable garden.<br>He didn't mention the endless waves of <strong>meat lovers</strong> who show up every night to burn you and the farm to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vegetables Are Explosive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow seeds and harvest a variety of crops while the sun is out. Each with <strong>unique</strong> traits.<br>Stock up before nightfall and prepare to survive what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Meat Lovers Are Here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They hate vegetables. They hate you. Your crops are both. Repair and reinforce your fences, and use <strong>explosive crops</strong> to hold the line. Defend your harvest and see how many nights you can last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>One Coin per Night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend it on new areas, trade with NPCs for power-ups and rewards, or drop it in the <strong>wishing well</strong> and pray.<br>Spend it wrong, and the run is over. In co-op, argue about where it goes before tomorrow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>All Hands on Deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A farm under siege needs <strong>everyone</strong>. Team up with up to <strong>4 friends</strong> and push your run as <strong>far</strong> as you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/57a84f1f0dfdb12b18264efd4ab09f54.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/57a84f1f0dfdb12b18264efd4ab09f54.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/57a84f1f0dfdb12b18264efd4ab09f54.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Uncle Sam's counting on you.<br><br>Good luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncle Sam left for a week-long vacation and put you in charge of his vegetable garden.<br>He didn't mention the endless waves of <strong>meat lovers</strong> who show up every night to burn you and the farm to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vegetables Are Explosive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow seeds and harvest a variety of crops while the sun is out. Each with <strong>unique</strong> traits.<br>Stock up before nightfall and prepare to survive what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/58a39c860493640be57fd369e84ff30e.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Meat Lovers Are Here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They hate vegetables. They hate you. Your crops are both. Repair and reinforce your fences, and use <strong>explosive crops</strong> to hold the line. Defend your harvest and see how many nights you can last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/0dcbcfa10c5d9f7d2fceecfbf93218e5.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>One Coin per Night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend it on new areas, trade with NPCs for power-ups and rewards, or drop it in the <strong>wishing well</strong> and pray.<br>Spend it wrong, and the run is over. In co-op, argue about where it goes before tomorrow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.webm?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/d9dcf59d0f6660901c1e34c1fded09bf.mp4?t=1788221205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>All Hands on Deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A farm under siege needs <strong>everyone</strong>. Team up with up to <strong>4 friends</strong> and push your run as <strong>far</strong> as you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/extras/57a84f1f0dfdb12b18264efd4ab09f54.poster.avif?t=1788221205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118860/e